<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on the DAX index.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on the DAX index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank N.A. in New York, Frankfurt branch has issued 40 million American-style call and put warrants, in four equal tranches, on the DAX index, lead manager Citibank S.A. said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 06.MAY.97-07.JUL.98   PAYDATE	12.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS		     MIN EXER LOT 2000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  3568 (O6.MAY.97)  DEM/FRF 3.37</p>
<p>* * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE     STRIKE    ISSUE     PREMIUM    GEARING</p>
<p> CALL     4000	5.89 FRF  17.01 PCT  20.4 X</p>
<p> CALL     3500	14.52 FRF 10.17 PCT  8.30 X</p>
<p> PUT	3500	 7.57 FRF -8.20 PCT  15.9 X</p>
<p> PUT	3200	 4.34 FRF -13.92 PCT 27.7 X</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
